    "summary": "Head-dress (composite) made of leaves (wild date), cane and tin-foil (red and gold colours). Leaf loops all around head-band; three bands of folded leaves to form triangle shapes and covered in tin-foil (red and gold colours). Above this, flat semi-circular section covered in tin-foil (gold colour) with folded leaves covered in tin-foil (red and gold colours) forming triangles to outer edge; leaves fan out across top of head-dress. At base of head-dress, four pendants made from interlocking leaf loops with circular motif to each end.",
